        "created_at": "2014-02-18T23:59:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If Parse targets herself with Between the Lines, or Unity targets herself with Hasty Augmentation, can they use a Power in their Power phase, or has their one power per turn been used up?</p>",
