        "raw": "<p>they get an additional power. Any time that phrasing is used -- may do ____ now -- it does not count towards the limit on how many you can do per turn. That&#39;s why you can chain together all 3 of Tachyon&#39;s Fleet of Foots, Hud Goggles, Pushing The Limits, Lightspeed Reflexes (play 2 cards now), Lightspeed Reflexes, and still be able to play 3 more cards before your play phase is up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The only exceptions that come to mind are</p><p>A.) Vengeance Blade&#39;s Impulsion Beam, which SPECIFICALLY limits each hero to 1 play and 1 power per turn, no matter what,</p><p>and</p><p>B.) The standing rule that you can only use EACH power once per turn. So unless you have a Gauge or Seg Fault or something in play already, you might want to give the power to someone else so you CAN do something during your power phase.</p>",
